      "writtenOn": "2023-05-25T20:52:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On second thought, should we instead just be returning an ImageAsset? It seems like it would more helpful to hold onto than an SkImage, and more consistent. I\u0027ll make the changes but replace SkImage with an skresources::ImageAsset, take a look and lmk what you think.",
